# Fear of Missing Out: the delirium trigger has an intervening "if there are four or more card types among cards in your
# graveyard" (CR 603.4, 700.2). The graveyard holds an Ornithopter (artifact and creature), a spent Black Lotus (artifact) and two
# Lightning Bolts (instant): three types, one short of the existing scenario's four (its Forest adds land). On turn 3 it attacks, the
# trigger does not happen, nothing untaps and there is no additional combat phase: Bot2 is hit once, for 2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Ornithopter
Black Lotus
Lightning Bolt
Fear of Missing Out
Lightning Bolt
Forest
Forest
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
